message: "If you use peekaudit, please cite it as below."
title: peekaudit
abstract: >-
  Simulation audit of the sequential-testing guarantees of open-source A/B testing
  engines: false-positive rate under peeking, coverage at the stopping time, power and
  expected sample size, with exact intervals and multiple-testing control.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "peekaudit contributors"
